##OpenGL GLIB
Perspective 90
LookAt  0 0 7 0 0 0  0 1 0



Vertex   snake.vert
Fragment snake.frag
Program  SnakeH  			\
		amplitude <0. .5 20.>\
		scaleFactor <1., 4.0, 100.0> \
		Timer <0. 0. 10.>   \
		speed <0., 5.0, 20.>\
		radius <0., .5, 10.>\
		

Color 1. 1. 1.
Obj snakeH.obj 1.0 1 1

// I am going to split the grass and snake shaders
Texture2D 6 grass.bmp

Vertex grass.vert
Fragment grass.frag
Program Grass
		uColorUnit 6

QuadXZ   -0.1 100.0 128 128